    description: "PR #2318 added three functions to entrypoint_kinds.py that only tests called; per-PR CI and the pre-PR script passed, and the scheduled full suite at c53ea871d went red on self-tree-validation an hour after the merge (fixed by PR #2321). The gate needs a behaviour map of the repository (5-6 min locally with one output file), which is why it is not per-PR. Options to weigh: run 'scripts/check-test-only-reachability --map' in the pre-PR script when a commit of the branch adds a def under packages/*/src (the map costs one self-analysis; the ARCHITECTURE.md regeneration already pays for one of packages/ when it runs); or a cheap AST-only pre-check for a new function with no production reference by name. Evidence: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/pr7/redfix/verify.txt (the gate run locally on dev and on the fix)."  # e66b
